					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>Marina, Geologist is wandering around in sadness.

The final straw was: Tired.</text>
				</li>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>BadNonUrgent</def>
					<label>Solar flare</label>
					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>A solar flare has begun.

The intense radiation will shut down all electrical devices.

It should pass in about a day.</text>
				</li>
